6.Cloud NAT and Cloud Router
NAT = Lets VMs without an external IPs start outbound connection to the internet.
Cloud NAT is a managed service 
it configured per region on cloud router
only out -bounded initiated connection works.

7.Private Google Access
A subnet setting that lets VMs with only internal IPs reach google APIs and services like cloud storage.
Enabled per subnet.

8.VPC Peering : Lab
